 },
 art:{
  intro:[
   'The QR Code Generator turns any web address, message, email address, phone number or Wi-Fi login into a scannable QR code in a fraction of a second. You can choose the size, colors, quiet-zone margin and error-correction level, then download the finished code as a PNG image for documents and screens or as an SVG file for print and logos.',
   'Many online QR generators send your text to a server or create short-lived codes that stop working. This one builds the code entirely in your browser using a built-in encoder, so the QR code contains exactly what you typed, has no expiry date and never depends on our website to keep working.'
