   'Sharing a contact number or email address at a stall or conference.'
  ],
  faqs:[
   ['Do the QR codes expire?','No. The code stores your text directly, so it works for as long as the destination itself works. These are static QR codes, not dynamic codes that depend on a tracking service.'],
   ['Which error-correction level should I choose?','Medium (15%) suits most uses. Choose High (30%) for codes that will be printed on rough surfaces or partly covered by a logo, and Low (7%) for long text where you want the smallest code.'],
   ['Why will my QR code not scan?','The most common causes are low contrast, inverted colors, a missing quiet zone or printing the code too small. Use a dark code on a light background, keep the margin at 2 or more and print it at least 2 cm wide.'],
