  ],
  faqs:[
   ['Can I extract pages in a different order than the original?','The tool keeps pages in ascending order regardless of how you type the range, so page 5 always appears after page 3. To reorder pages, use the Merge PDF tool with single-page extracts.'],
   ['What happens to pages I do not list?','They are left out of the downloaded file entirely. The original file on your device is never changed.'],
   ['Why do I get an error saying the PDF could not be read?','This usually means the file is corrupted, is not a real PDF, or is protected with a password that prevents opening. Try opening it in a PDF reader first to confirm it works.'],
