   'Checking a file&rsquo;s exact size in bytes against an upload limit.',
   'Spotting a file with a misleading extension, such as a document saved with the wrong file ending.',
   'Quickly listing details for several files at once, such as before archiving them.'
  ],
  faqs:[
   ['Why does the MIME type sometimes say &ldquo;unknown type&rdquo;?','Browsers detect MIME types based on the file extension and, for some formats, the file contents. Unusual or uncommon file types may not be recognized and will show as unknown.'],
   ['Does this tool open or scan the contents of my file?','No. It only reads the metadata your browser already exposes for a selected file, such as its name, size, type and modified date. The file&rsquo;s contents are not read or uploaded.'],
   ['Can I check the size of a very large file?','Yes, there is no size limit for checking file details, since the file itself is never loaded into memory for this tool.']
  ]
 }
});

}catch(e){if(window.console){console.error(e);}}})(window.TH);

