   ['What does &ldquo;Straighten quotes &amp; dashes&rdquo; actually change?','It converts curly opening and closing quotes and apostrophes into straight ones, converts em dashes and en dashes into a plain hyphen, and converts an ellipsis character into three periods.'],
   ['What happens if I strip HTML tags from plain text that has none?','Nothing changes. The option only removes actual HTML tags if any are present; text without tags passes through unaffected.'],
   ['Is my text uploaded anywhere?','No. Cleaning happens locally in your browser using JavaScript, so your text never leaves your device.']
  ]
 }
});

