 html:'<p>Welcome to <strong>{SITE}</strong>, a collection of free online tools designed to make everyday tasks quicker and simpler. From counting words and generating secure passwords to compressing images, converting units and formatting JSON, our goal is to give you a dependable tool that opens instantly and does exactly what it says.</p>'
