TH.addPage({slug:'privacy-policy',title:'Privacy Policy',
 desc:'How this website handles your data: what we collect, how cookies and Google AdSense work, and the choices you have.',
 html:'<p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>{SITE}</strong> (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;) collects, uses and protects information when you visit <a href="{HOME}">{HOME}</a>. By using the website you agree to the practices described here. Last updated: {UPDATED}.</p>'
 +'<h2>Information processed by our tools</h2><p>All tools on this website run locally in your browser. Text you type, files you select and values you calculate are processed on your own device and are not uploaded to or stored on our servers. When you close the page, that content is gone.</p>'
 +'<h2>Information we collect</h2><p>We do not require registration and we do not ask for personal information to use the tools. Like most websites, our hosting platform and analytics tools may automatically receive standard technical data, such as your IP address, browser type, device type, referring page and the pages you view. This information is used to keep the site secure, understand usage and improve performance. If you contact us by email, we receive your email address and the content of your message, which we use only to reply.</p>'
